## Note on Audiokinetic Wwise

This project is an **independent, unofficial** integration layer. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Audiokinetic Inc.

Audiokinetic Wwise is commercial software. **No Wwise SDK files — headers,
static libraries, dynamic libraries, or tools — are distributed in this
repository.** You must obtain your own Wwise installation and license from
<https://www.audiokinetic.com/> and comply with its terms, including the
conditions under which Wwise runtime libraries may be redistributed with your
application.

The C shim and Dart code in this repository are original work released under
the MIT license above.
